WEBVTT

00:20.092 --> 00:25.323
It happened shortly after our
middle school graduation.

00:28.091 --> 00:29.634
[Anzai Masaki: You good? Whenever you get
sick of all that studying, give me a call]

00:29.634 --> 00:30.885
[Hell, even if you don't]

00:30.885 --> 00:31.678
[Let's hit the beach]

00:31.678 --> 00:32.050
[Let's hit the beach]
We just graduated yesterday, dude.

00:32.050 --> 00:34.344
We just graduated yesterday, dude.

00:34.787 --> 00:35.778
Come on!

00:36.603 --> 00:38.221
Hand it over, now!

00:38.867 --> 00:40.793
P-Please give it back!

00:40.849 --> 00:44.012
Seriously? This is all you've got?!

00:44.123 --> 00:45.938
Damn, talk about broke.

00:46.073 --> 00:47.981
I need that!

00:48.166 --> 00:49.618
Shut your mouth!

00:50.504 --> 00:52.996
If you need it that bad, ask mommy for more!

00:54.221 --> 00:56.338
I mean it. Give it b…

00:56.560 --> 00:58.098
Shut! Up!

01:01.101 --> 01:02.658
Hey, jerks!

01:03.021 --> 01:06.590
You think you're tough, ganging up on one guy?!

01:09.316 --> 01:10.886
H-Hey, jerks!

01:11.470 --> 01:12.141
Huh?

01:13.101 --> 01:14.726
Y-You need…

01:15.052 --> 01:17.790
t-to return that… right now!

01:20.732 --> 01:22.701
You gotta learn your place!

01:22.750 --> 01:23.895
What's your problem?!

01:24.043 --> 01:25.403
Hand it over!

01:25.446 --> 01:26.492
Come on!

01:26.553 --> 01:28.264
Give us all you got!

01:28.359 --> 01:30.535
That's a pretty shitty thing to do!

01:31.581 --> 01:33.409
Huh? What's with this guy?

01:33.470 --> 01:34.732
Hey, what are you d…!

01:49.692 --> 01:51.753
Thank you so, so much.

01:52.332 --> 01:54.024
Um, are you okay?

01:54.307 --> 01:55.704
I'm fine. Just fine.

01:55.926 --> 01:57.520
Thanks again!

02:00.775 --> 02:01.747
Figures.

02:02.258 --> 02:04.578
I can't be cool like him.

02:05.993 --> 02:07.175
That said…

02:07.520 --> 02:09.224
This guy's something else.

02:09.470 --> 02:11.870
Hey, you're a pretty cool guy.

02:14.000 --> 02:16.338
N-No, I'm horribly weak and…

02:16.340 --> 02:17.483
No, you're not.

02:18.073 --> 02:21.716
Taking a group on alone isn't
something just anyone can do.

02:22.283 --> 02:24.603
Especially not for a total stranger.

02:26.775 --> 02:30.018
I've been looking for guys like you.

02:30.861 --> 02:34.609
I'd love to have you join my team.

02:35.716 --> 02:38.443
I'm sure you'll like it.

02:41.729 --> 02:43.876
P-Pardon the intrusion.

02:48.683 --> 02:49.913
Hey, bud!

02:50.270 --> 02:51.526
Glad you made it!

02:51.907 --> 02:55.809
Lemme reintroduce myself. I'm Natori,
the boss here. Good to have you.

02:57.156 --> 02:59.212
G-Good to be here.

02:59.612 --> 03:01.901
S-So he's their leader?

03:02.221 --> 03:03.747
No wonder he's so strong.

03:05.538 --> 03:09.476
What?! What did you just say?! Say that again!

03:09.729 --> 03:12.590
You know you can't leave the team!

03:14.203 --> 03:15.833
Um, what's that about?

03:15.987 --> 03:19.784
Oh, looks like that kid said
he wanted to leave the team.

03:19.876 --> 03:21.858
A-And you're not gonna stop them?

03:26.812 --> 03:28.141
I knew it.

03:28.763 --> 03:30.523
You're a really good guy.

03:32.120 --> 03:37.003
It's easy to control weak people with
disproportionately strong moral compasses.

03:37.630 --> 03:39.538
You make great marks.

03:40.320 --> 03:43.895
And once a mark walks in, they never leave.

03:44.904 --> 03:49.938
Because here, violence and fear dominate.

03:51.655 --> 03:53.230
Welcome to KEEL.

03:58.572 --> 04:01.249
Thirty grand. Three days.

04:07.827 --> 04:10.387
Three days. Five grand this time.

04:12.695 --> 04:14.523
This ain't enough!

04:17.347 --> 04:18.627
Oh well.

04:19.261 --> 04:24.713
If you're short, we'll just have to punch you
for every thousand you're missing.

04:50.726 --> 04:51.667
I see…

04:52.627 --> 04:54.516
I'm sorry, Nagato.

04:58.806 --> 05:00.713
If only I was stronger…

05:01.815 --> 05:05.335
I could have pulled you out
then, by force if necessary.

05:06.006 --> 05:08.086
I-I'm really sor…

05:08.090 --> 05:08.646
No!

05:09.930 --> 05:14.953
Even if you'd beaten them all back then,
I wouldn't have gone with you.

05:16.203 --> 05:17.833
I couldn't have.

05:19.040 --> 05:21.581
After doing such shitty things,

05:22.215 --> 05:23.840
I don't have the right.

05:24.320 --> 05:25.070
What do you…

05:25.070 --> 05:25.938
I've always…

05:31.716 --> 05:33.563
…wanted to be like you.

05:35.710 --> 05:38.849
Wanted to be cool and strong like you.

05:40.270 --> 05:44.141
When I joined, I thought I was
taking a step towards that goal.

05:45.316 --> 05:49.796
But it was no use. I couldn't be cool or strong.

05:54.196 --> 05:57.390
You dumbass. What are you saying?

06:00.830 --> 06:01.575
Nagato!

06:01.686 --> 06:03.070
A-Are you okay?!

06:03.220 --> 06:06.184
Anzai! I told you that was dangerous!

06:06.215 --> 06:07.175
S-Sorry!

06:09.981 --> 06:11.249
What do we do, Anzai?

06:11.464 --> 06:12.443
What do we do?!

06:15.033 --> 06:17.384
I-I'm okay.

06:17.913 --> 06:21.624
I'm just glad you two didn't get hurt.

06:23.175 --> 06:24.615
You've always been…

06:25.181 --> 06:28.166
so strong, and so cool.

08:22.276 --> 08:24.824
Huh? I'm…

08:26.689 --> 08:29.513
Oh, my bad, Nire. Did I wake ya?

08:29.600 --> 08:31.864
Ah…! Wait, what?

08:32.123 --> 08:33.193
Where are we…?

08:33.770 --> 08:36.732
- Yeah, I'm fine.
- Dude, you were so…

08:37.175 --> 08:39.470
We're on the way home from the fight.

08:39.655 --> 08:40.824
Kiryu…

08:41.526 --> 08:42.400
Whoa…

08:42.750 --> 08:44.787
It all worked out, huh?

08:46.006 --> 08:48.516
I'm glad everyone seems to be okay.

08:48.756 --> 08:51.021
Yeah, yer the least okay one here.

08:51.101 --> 08:54.283
Huh? Oh, Sorry! I'm okay now! I can walk!

08:54.344 --> 08:57.009
Nah, s'fine. This's good exercise.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.236
Ow!

09:01.316 --> 09:04.006
Hey, quiddit, Suo! He's injured!

09:04.166 --> 09:07.926
I figured you were a sadist,
Suo. What's the matter?

09:08.270 --> 09:09.440
Seriously…

09:09.969 --> 09:13.113
I thought you'd gone crazy when you rushed out.

09:16.904 --> 09:18.713
Don't push your luck like that.

09:19.729 --> 09:20.990
Sorry…

09:21.095 --> 09:25.600
Yeah, but 'cuz ya messaged the second-years,

09:25.790 --> 09:27.310
it all worked out fer us.

09:28.092 --> 09:28.966
Good on ya.

09:29.403 --> 09:30.646
No, it was nothing…

09:31.132 --> 09:33.950
W-Wait… I don't see Sakura here.

09:34.172 --> 09:35.433
Ain't he behind us?

09:37.513 --> 09:38.498
Sakura!

09:48.289 --> 09:50.455
I'm glad you're okay, too.

09:51.600 --> 09:53.378
Worry about yourself.

09:53.741 --> 09:56.658
You really are incredible, Sakura.

09:58.523 --> 10:02.153
You only just became grade rep,
but you got everyone together

10:02.436 --> 10:04.455
and neatly resolved the problem.

10:04.892 --> 10:07.040
I mean it, really, great wor…

10:07.040 --> 10:07.932
It wasn't great.

10:09.593 --> 10:11.009
How was that incredible?!

10:12.769 --> 10:15.587
I talked big, said I could handle it myself,

10:16.344 --> 10:17.975
but I could barely do anything.

10:18.824 --> 10:22.436
I got lost in my head, barely even beat a wimp,

10:23.033 --> 10:25.809
and needed the second-years to wipe my ass for me.

10:26.412 --> 10:28.338
What part of that is incredible?!

10:29.501 --> 10:33.033
Some grade rep! You got knocked out,

10:33.778 --> 10:36.006
and everyone else got all beat up!

10:36.873 --> 10:39.212
No matter how you cut it, it's my fault!

10:40.123 --> 10:41.987
I know you all think so, too!

10:42.713 --> 10:44.781
So say it! Blame me!

10:48.283 --> 10:50.135
S-Sakura…

10:52.264 --> 10:53.815
Quit talking nonsense.

10:55.476 --> 10:59.021
I could never have gotten Nagato out on my own.

10:59.827 --> 11:03.520
I don't care what anyone thinks,
I'm nothing but grateful to you.

11:04.824 --> 11:06.732
Thank you, Sakura.

11:08.406 --> 11:09.526
Besides,

11:10.018 --> 11:12.720
us getting knocked around is our own fault,

11:12.910 --> 11:14.523
not yours.

11:14.750 --> 11:15.901
Damn straight.

11:17.692 --> 11:18.781
Sakura.

11:19.403 --> 11:21.993
Everyone's frustrated here.

11:24.270 --> 11:27.464
Us not bein' strong enough is on us.

11:27.784 --> 11:29.101
Even Sugi.

11:29.624 --> 11:33.526
Bet you don't know how to face Ume now, do you?

11:35.009 --> 11:37.206
It might not mean much coming from me,

11:37.821 --> 11:40.443
but please don't try to shoulder this alone.

11:41.513 --> 11:44.443
We're all friends, aren't we?

11:46.960 --> 11:51.206
He's right, Sakura. Especially for us vice-reps.

11:51.716 --> 11:53.415
We bear responsibility, too.

11:56.947 --> 11:59.698
So let's make a fresh start, together.

12:00.350 --> 12:01.040
Yeah!

12:03.446 --> 12:04.732
Ooooh.

12:09.520 --> 12:11.950
What is this feeling?

12:13.630 --> 12:15.913
Ever since I saw them get beat up,

12:16.633 --> 12:18.510
there's been a pit in my stomach.

12:19.390 --> 12:24.043
And I never would have struggled
with a guy like him before…

12:25.120 --> 12:25.993
So why…?

12:26.972 --> 12:28.664
What happened to me?

12:35.870 --> 12:39.396
This's been a good experrrience. Forrr them, too.

12:40.710 --> 12:45.033
It's just like what happened when
you firrrst became grrrade rep.

12:45.476 --> 12:48.449
You were terrrified of Hirrragi back then.

12:48.843 --> 12:50.455
Ain't that so, Kaji?

12:52.147 --> 12:54.941
Forget that. What did you think of that team?

12:56.320 --> 13:00.449
Well, forrr a new team we didn't know much about,

13:00.578 --> 13:02.393
therrre werrre a lot of them.

13:03.027 --> 13:05.907
Therrre something else that
caught yourrr attention?

13:06.523 --> 13:07.341
Yeah…

13:07.889 --> 13:11.790
I don't believe that guy could recruit
that many people himself.

13:12.849 --> 13:15.144
It doesn't feel right.

13:23.991 --> 13:28.123
[Ashitaba]

13:28.123 --> 13:31.009
Umemiya said he's at this restaurant.

13:31.464 --> 13:32.313
So…

13:32.683 --> 13:35.563
You guys'rrre gonna give him a full rrreport!

13:37.698 --> 13:39.796
You really are a fun guy!

13:40.732 --> 13:42.713
Yeah! I told you so!

13:42.818 --> 13:45.692
One cola for Ume, General!

13:46.110 --> 13:46.910
Comin' up!

13:47.360 --> 13:48.030
Oh?

13:48.849 --> 13:50.904
Hey! Welcome back, guys!

13:51.003 --> 13:53.501
Yo. Sorrrry to botherrr you while you eat.

13:53.593 --> 13:57.286
Don't be! I was just helping
the man unload some stuff.

13:58.720 --> 14:00.972
And how did that lead to this…?

14:03.661 --> 14:05.433
And that's what happened.

14:09.126 --> 14:11.347
I'm really sorry about this.

14:11.809 --> 14:13.095
I'm sorry.

14:20.258 --> 14:22.227
Actually listen to this.

14:25.347 --> 14:28.086
Alright, got it. Nice work.

14:29.649 --> 14:30.953
Hey.

14:31.175 --> 14:32.923
Y'all should eat this.

14:33.120 --> 14:36.603
Huh?! Can we?! You're givin' us
some space and some food?!

14:36.806 --> 14:38.061
Thanks!

14:38.221 --> 14:39.784
It's nothin'!

14:40.664 --> 14:42.603
Now, let's eat!

14:43.286 --> 14:44.387
U-Um…

14:44.683 --> 14:46.695
Is that it…?

14:47.076 --> 14:48.289
Is that what?

14:48.787 --> 14:49.556
I…

14:50.307 --> 14:53.273
roped Furin into my own problem.

14:53.680 --> 14:55.236
You can say that,

14:55.643 --> 14:57.803
but Nagato's your friend, isn't he?

14:58.092 --> 15:00.744
Then it's only natural Furin would save him.

15:01.224 --> 15:03.513
But the upperclassmen got involved, too…

15:03.809 --> 15:06.307
Upperclassmen look out for their juniors.

15:08.627 --> 15:09.649
Even so…

15:12.387 --> 15:13.273
I'm really,

15:14.215 --> 15:15.606
truly sorry!

15:26.516 --> 15:27.249
Nagato.

15:29.612 --> 15:30.160
Eat.

15:31.686 --> 15:32.418
Um…

15:32.646 --> 15:33.630
Go ahead.

15:55.729 --> 15:56.756
You like it?

15:57.353 --> 15:57.963
Yes.

15:59.335 --> 16:02.806
It's been so long since I thought
anything tasted good…

16:04.215 --> 16:06.787
Never forget that flavor.

16:09.680 --> 16:13.403
When things are rough, we can't
even afford to taste anything.

16:13.920 --> 16:19.581
But, you see, when you eat with someone
who truly puts you at peace,

16:22.467 --> 16:25.027
it's oddly delicious, isn't it?

16:29.218 --> 16:31.310
There's no changing what you've done.

16:32.812 --> 16:35.095
No matter who thinks what about it,

16:35.569 --> 16:37.298
you have to live with it.

16:38.916 --> 16:42.030
You probably have a lot of rough times in store.

16:42.929 --> 16:44.713
But when they come, remember.

16:45.310 --> 16:46.264
That flavor?

16:46.720 --> 16:49.132
It's the proof you're not in this alone.

16:52.295 --> 16:52.953
'Kay?

16:56.627 --> 16:57.360
Okay.

16:58.141 --> 17:00.615
Now, go on! Eat up!

17:00.787 --> 17:02.227
Th-Thank you!

17:02.621 --> 17:06.683
It doesn't take long for them to
start eating after a fight, does it?

17:06.886 --> 17:07.673
Nope.

17:10.338 --> 17:12.683
What's wrong, Sakura? You seem down.

17:13.550 --> 17:14.436
It's nothing.

17:14.972 --> 17:18.307
The rest of us all got beat up,

17:18.640 --> 17:21.969
and Sakura felt responsible for it all.

17:22.344 --> 17:22.890
Hm?

17:22.890 --> 17:24.566
Don't put words in my mouth!

17:25.372 --> 17:27.550
I'm just pissed at myself.

17:28.344 --> 17:29.895
I talked a big game,

17:30.473 --> 17:32.332
and normally I would've been fine,

17:33.156 --> 17:36.424
but for some reason I couldn't
move like I usually do.

17:40.916 --> 17:41.753
Sakura.

17:42.750 --> 17:44.812
Did you stop being able to move well…

17:45.218 --> 17:47.587
after you saw your friends all beat up?

17:51.772 --> 17:55.286
If so, then there's only one possibility.

17:57.673 --> 18:00.843
It's because you like them.

18:03.120 --> 18:06.160
Wh-Why are you always saying that?!

18:07.600 --> 18:08.732
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

18:09.956 --> 18:11.593
That looked like it hurt!

18:11.778 --> 18:14.012
Kaji, at least react!

18:14.160 --> 18:15.686
I'm touched, Sakura.

18:15.741 --> 18:18.221
E-Excuse me, could we get a towel?!

18:20.344 --> 18:20.855
Look!

18:23.458 --> 18:25.440
[Restaurant Ashitaba]

18:25.827 --> 18:27.550
Take care now!

18:32.412 --> 18:33.815
So, Hiragi.

18:34.049 --> 18:34.633
Hm?

18:35.138 --> 18:38.436
What did you think about what Sakura said?

18:42.055 --> 18:43.507
Same as you, I suppose.

18:47.827 --> 18:50.160
He's gonna get real strong.

18:54.252 --> 18:58.313
Hey, Ume, Hiragi! If yer done
talkin', get back in here!

18:58.406 --> 18:59.938
I fried up some katsu!

19:00.000 --> 19:01.993
Wait, for reals?! Nice!

19:02.295 --> 19:03.649
You're still hungry?

19:11.452 --> 19:12.400
Nagato!

19:19.446 --> 19:21.421
Tsuchiya, I…

19:26.916 --> 19:28.147
H-Hey, Tsuchi…

19:28.150 --> 19:29.255
Are you idiots?!

19:34.135 --> 19:37.470
You're both so beat up…

19:42.123 --> 19:43.156
Welcome back!

19:47.009 --> 19:47.581
Mhm.

19:55.655 --> 19:57.144
Ah, wait a sec!

19:58.320 --> 20:00.836
I still haven't asked your name.

20:02.350 --> 20:03.316
Sakura.

20:04.018 --> 20:06.953
Okay. Sakura, then.

20:09.993 --> 20:12.406
Thank you, Sakura.

20:14.603 --> 20:16.596
I-It was nothing.

20:17.883 --> 20:19.815
I just kept my promise.

22:12.412 --> 22:13.409
Damn.

22:14.320 --> 22:18.203
I came all this way 'cause I heard
you'd be fighting Furin.

22:19.464 --> 22:20.880
Up we go.

22:21.680 --> 22:23.920
Why'd you shits go and lose?

22:24.916 --> 22:29.587
Especially when Furin's gotten
even weaker'n I thought…

22:30.338 --> 22:33.575
Oh, but they were first-years, right?

22:34.135 --> 22:36.227
Even so, this is a bit much.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.529
He'd be pissed for sure.

22:40.935 --> 22:41.993
Even so…

22:42.812 --> 22:45.273
Looks like KEEL's done.

22:45.723 --> 22:48.886
They got pretty big, too. What a waste.

22:49.587 --> 22:50.320
Still…

22:50.775 --> 22:53.550
Because that damn fool did whatever he wanted,

22:53.680 --> 22:56.289
it already rotted to the core.

22:57.341 --> 23:01.606
Right when I was thinking of punching him
back into line, this happens.

23:02.910 --> 23:05.378
I seriously suck at judging people.

23:06.116 --> 23:12.763
But looking at it another way, this business
with Furin put a good card in my hand.

23:13.273 --> 23:16.498
Yeah, that's it. We'll go with that.

23:17.033 --> 23:19.680
You did one good thing in the end.

23:22.067 --> 23:24.104
Later, KEEL.

23:25.452 --> 23:28.141
You helped me kill some time, at least.

23:30.406 --> 23:34.843
Dammit, he thinks he can wrap
everything up with "you like them".

23:35.335 --> 23:38.449
He says the same thing after every fight!

23:39.003 --> 23:40.996
Sakura, your face is red.

23:41.083 --> 23:43.796
He tries to hide it, but he's still an open book.

23:44.504 --> 23:45.766
That's not it at all!

23:45.809 --> 23:47.483
Huh?! It's not?!

23:47.520 --> 23:50.560
Aww, too bad. And right when
you were so happy, Nire.

23:50.560 --> 23:54.830
Right? And here I was thinking
Sakura was finally opening up…

23:56.276 --> 23:59.618
G-Give me those eyes all you
want, I won't admit a thing!
